a lot to share today...There's a brand new trailer for the game! Have a watch:This is the best look at Fakutori so far: the elements, the discovery, the factories, and a few things I won't spoil! I'm really proud of how it came together, so I hope you enjoy it.Now, onto the rest of the news…Firstly, Fakutori has found a home. I've teamed up with Mythwright to bring the game to launch, and I couldn't be happier about it! They're the folks behind games like Thronefall, Going M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T17:06:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1459800-1817483467046494","game_id":"steam-1459800","kind":"update","title":"Development update - December 2025","summary":"Hey all! Sorry for the long silence over here, I'll try to post more frequent updates...Development of Fakutori is progressing well! I've added a lot of content since the demo, which you'll get to try out when the full game comes out. Here's a sneak peek focused on new element blocks!Let's start with these four new blocks : Ice, Obsidian, Black Fire and Astralite! Ice can cool blocks with the property \"burning\", like Fire or Lava, which transforms them into something else. Here's how it looks wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-01T20:44:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467046494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1459800-1809869180010592","game_id":"steam-1459800","kind":"announcement","title":"Fakutori's demo gets an overhaul!","summary":"Good news, everyone! After months of work and playtesting, I'm happy to announce a new version of the demo!This is mostly a technical update: huge chunks of the game's code and systems have been rewritten. The result: increased stability, fewer bugs, and most importantly, a dramatic increase in framerate! Wakas reported up to 10 times the framerate in some cases, which is especially noticeable on very big factories. You know what that means: time to build even bigger factories!The content itself","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-03T20:16:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809869180010592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1459800-5747233970430934028","game_id":"steam-1459800","kind":"announcement","title":"Fakutori has been announced !","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45004328/0285d46327bfcefd40bb35788bdcdb6262e445e2.jpg Fakutori was announced yesterday during Games Made in France, a french streaming event dedicated to highlight national and regional game makers. We really enjoyed watching people discover Fakutori, asking questions about its setting and mechanics, and being generally curious about the game. If you're reading this, you're probably already part of our group of wishlisters, and if you're not : what are you waiting for ? Wishli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-19T22:58:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5747233970430934028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1459800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:58:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:58:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1459800":"2026-10-25T23:58:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1459800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:58:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-2